    "name": "SPIDER HOTEL",
    "steam_appid": 3648840,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing a casual, asymmetrical multiplayer battle game! Become small insects and enjoy a thrilling game of tag, 1 vs 4.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once grand and prosperous, the hotel has long since fallen into ruin after its owner mysteriously vanished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years later, four peculiar guests wandered into this silent, abandoned hotel\u2014a curious Fly, a skillful Earwig, a laid-back Slug, and a sweet yet slightly clumsy Gummy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648840/extras/24ddf1a251cbd34c0341679bc17a2540.avif?t=1753082528\" data-has-big width=800 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moment they stepped inside, they realized\u2014 A new manager was already here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sinister Spider moves swiftly through walls, ceilings, and shadows, relentlessly hunting its prey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, the four guests must unravel the hotel's hidden mysteries and find a way out. But if captured, they'll be wrapped in cocoons, becoming a permanent part of the hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will manage to escape\u2014or will everyone inevitably be caught in the Spider's web?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets beyond your imagination await inside this hotel\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648840/extras/e19c6ad5b7cbd33179079220bdec56bb.avif?t=1753082528\" data-has-big width=800 height=357 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fly</strong><br>Swiftly fly around and survive with hit-and-run tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earwig</strong><br>A reliable character with both speed and attack power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slug</strong><br>Can move freely on walls and ceilings. Special invisibility skill excels at rescuing teammates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gummy</strong><br>A somewhat unreliable yet mysterious character whose unique abilities support the team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spider</strong><br>A ruthless hunter that moves swiftly in the shadows, dominating the game by capturing its prey.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME MODES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An online multiplayer chase game. Players are divided into &quot;Runners&quot; (escaping players) and &quot;Chasers&quot; (the pursuing Spider), battling for survival.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven mode that can be played solo offline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAPS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RAINY BEACH</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massive cave spreads beneath the old resort hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648840/extras/ffe12efb6080f49af8e6c215dc8b249e.avif?t=1753082528\" width=800 height=948 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GREEN HOUSE</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A greenhouse filled with strange pipes and trapped plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648840/extras/db5de1ced99456b3d40c43088ead52e5.avif?t=1753082528\" data-has-big width=800 height=599 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing a casual, asymmetrical multiplayer battle game! Become small insects and enjoy a thrilling game of tag, 1 vs 4.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once grand and prosperous, the hotel has long since fallen into ruin after its owner mysteriously vanished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years later, four peculiar guests wandered into this silent, abandoned hotel\u2014a curious Fly, a skillful Earwig, a laid-back Slug, and a sweet yet slightly clumsy Gummy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648840/extras/24ddf1a251cbd34c0341679bc17a2540.avif?t=1753082528\" data-has-big width=800 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moment they stepped inside, they realized\u2014 A new manager was already here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sinister Spider moves swiftly through walls, ceilings, and shadows, relentlessly hunting its prey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, the four guests must unravel the hotel's hidden mysteries and find a way out. But if captured, they'll be wrapped in cocoons, becoming a permanent part of the hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will manage to escape\u2014or will everyone inevitably be caught in the Spider's web?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets beyond your imagination await inside this hotel\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648840/extras/e19c6ad5b7cbd33179079220bdec56bb.avif?t=1753082528\" data-has-big width=800 height=357 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fly</strong><br>Swiftly fly around and survive with hit-and-run tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earwig</strong><br>A reliable character with both speed and attack power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slug</strong><br>Can move freely on walls and ceilings. Special invisibility skill excels at rescuing teammates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gummy</strong><br>A somewhat unreliable yet mysterious character whose unique abilities support the team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spider</strong><br>A ruthless hunter that moves swiftly in the shadows, dominating the game by capturing its prey.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME MODES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An online multiplayer chase game. Players are divided into &quot;Runners&quot; (escaping players) and &quot;Chasers&quot; (the pursuing Spider), battling for survival.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven mode that can be played solo offline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAPS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RAINY BEACH</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massive cave spreads beneath the old resort hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648840/extras/ffe12efb6080f49af8e6c215dc8b249e.avif?t=1753082528\" width=800 height=948 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GREEN HOUSE</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A greenhouse filled with strange pipes and trapped plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648840/extras/db5de1ced99456b3d40c43088ead52e5.avif?t=1753082528\" data-has-big width=800 height=599 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Enjoy a casual 1 vs 4 asymmetrical multiplayer game of tag! Four tiny insects are trapped in a strange hotel, hunted by a sinister Spider that swiftly moves through walls and ceilings. Use unique skills, work together, and escape\u2014or get wrapped in cocoons forever! Can you survive?",
